; village_gate_east.room - the village's east gate (design 04 section 3.1), out to threshold_fields. Flat; no gate or puzzle. The cobbles end at col 16: a dirt road with a grass verge leaves the village.
; The east gate (col 38, legend X, STORY-03): shut until the elder's story is heard ("East gate shut until the elder
; points east (Recommended)", user, 2026-10-15); no text, the gate just stays closed (systems/story).
; The sun stair's grate (WORLD-35): a FactGrate in the road (cols 29-32) over a vault (rows 10-11, cols 29-36) down into caldera_sun_stair, solid road until the summer guardian is restored (guardian_restored_summer.tres). Stone [back] lines the vault.

